ith the two judgments the presentation put before management, in `blog/posts/01-race-condition-in-a-law.md` under "An insurer's payout formula, and a rates rebate" (the judgments are in its note 9). "Six years" is the project's age at SMU as `blog/STYLE.md` §6 records it from Meng (2026-09-13).

