st's wording, since Meng's own account in `~/CLAUDE.md` calls the 2019 New Zealand exercise "a very early pilot." Its shape — "you must notify, and you must not notify" — is Meng's, recorded in `blog/README.md` under "Framing constraints — Post 1" (2026-09-14), and "advised not to" follows his wording that the regulator "may some time later advise the organization to not advise the affected parties."

