d`); "a lawyer's review of the result" is the pipeline's human gate, HG1, described in `doc/concepts/reviewing/reviewing-encoded-law.md` as a detached signature over the files reviewed. Nothing in the tree has run that pipeline over a landlord-and-tenant instrument; the sentence states a condition, not a schedule. An earlier revision placed this paragraph mid-post and closed it with "the rest is for the people who build the tools"; it now sits before the close.

